msgstr ""
"At this point you could install the same content into the cluster with "
"`kubectl apply -k my-cluster/kustomize/nginx`, without using Tazuna at all. "
"Understanding Tazuna becomes easier if you think of it as **just an extra "
"declarative-management layer placed on top**."

