msgstr "Reflect the contents of `main` into the cluster"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:14
msgid "`tazuna apply`（または `tazuna state sync`）"
msgstr "`tazuna apply` (or `tazuna state sync`)"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:14 src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:15
