msgid "tazuna build -f tazuna.yaml > rendered.yaml"
msgstr "tazuna build -f tazuna.yaml > rendered.yaml"

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:34
msgid ""
"PR で `build` 結果をアーティファクトに残しておくと、レビュー時に「最終的に何"
"が apply されるか」を レンダリング結果ベースで確認できます。`type: oras` を"
"使っているなら `--offline` を 付けて先取り cache を使う構成も検討できます"
"（[`tazuna build`](../reference/cli/build.md)）。"
msgstr ""
"Keeping `build` output as an artifact on PRs lets reviewers verify \"what "
"will ultimately be applied\" from the rendered result. If you use `type: "
"oras`, you can also consider running with `--offline` to leverage a pre-"
"warmed cache (see [`tazuna build`](../reference/cli/build.md))."

#: src/operations/ci-pipeline.md:38
