"`manifests[].includes[]` の各要素です。別の `tazuna.yaml` を読み込み、その "
"`manifests[]` を展開します。"
msgstr ""
"Each element of `manifests[].includes[]`. Loads another `tazuna.yaml` and "
"expands its `manifests[]`."

#: src/reference/tazuna-yaml.md:137
