"読み込む `tazuna.yaml` のパス。**呼び出し元の `tazuna.yaml` からの相対** で書"
"きます。"
msgstr ""
"Path to the `tazuna.yaml` to load. Written **relative to the calling "
"`tazuna.yaml`**."

