"glossary.md#contenthash) / [Diff type](../concepts/glossary.md#diff-type) / "
"[always-sync](../concepts/glossary.md#always-sync)"
msgstr ""
"Terminology: [State](../concepts/glossary.md#state) / [State key](../"
"concepts/glossary.md#state-key) / [ContentHash](../concepts/"
"glossary.md#contenthash) / [Diff type](../concepts/glossary.md#diff-type) / "
"[always-sync](../concepts/glossary.md#always-sync)"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:1
msgid "Manifest type 別リファレンス"
msgstr "Per-Manifest-Type Reference"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:3
msgid ""
"`tazuna.yaml` の `manifests[].type` には 5 種類の値を取れます。 このセクショ"
"ンでは type ごとの **`path` が指す先**、**固有フィールド**、 **apply / "
"destroy / build 時の振る舞い** を 1 ページずつにまとめます。"
msgstr ""
"`tazuna.yaml`'s `manifests[].type` can take 5 values. This section breaks "
"each type into its own page, covering **what `path` points to**, **type-"
"specific fields**, and **apply / destroy / build behavior**."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:7
msgid ""
"Manifest の共通フィールド（`name` / `path` / `type` / `tags` / `includes` / "
"`tests`）の仕様は [`tazuna.yaml` スキーマ - Manifest](../tazuna-"
"yaml.md#manifest) を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"For the spec of common Manifest fields (`name` / `path` / `type` / `tags` / "
"`includes` / `tests`), see [`tazuna.yaml` schema - Manifest](../tazuna-"
"yaml.md#manifest)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:12
msgid ""
"[`kustomize`](./kustomize.md) — kustomize でレンダリングしたリソースを反映す"
"る"
msgstr "[`kustomize`](./kustomize.md) — apply resources rendered by kustomize"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:13
msgid "[`helmfile`](./helmfile.md) — helmfile template の結果を反映する"
msgstr "[`helmfile`](./helmfile.md) — apply the result of helmfile template"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:14
msgid ""
"[`oras`](./oras.md) — OCI registry から artifact を pull し、helmfile / "
"kustomize に委譲する"
msgstr ""
"[`oras`](./oras.md) — pull an artifact from an OCI registry and delegate to "
"helmfile / kustomize"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:15
msgid "[`parallel`](./parallel.md) — 子 Manifest を並列に処理する"
msgstr "[`parallel`](./parallel.md) — process child Manifests in parallel"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:16
msgid ""
"[`genesissecret`](./genesissecret.md) — GenesisSecret YAML から Kubernetes "
"Secret を生成する"
msgstr ""
"[`genesissecret`](./genesissecret.md) — generate Kubernetes Secrets from a "
"GenesisSecret YAML"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:18
msgid "type と固有フィールドの対応"
msgstr "Type-to-Specific-Field Correspondence"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/index.md:20
msgid ""
"各 type は `manifests[]` 内で **対応するオプションオブジェクト** を持ちま"
"す。 `type` と対応するフィールドだけが読まれ、他は無視されます。"
msgstr ""
"Each type has a **corresponding options object** inside `manifests[]`. Only "
"the field corresponding to `type` is read; the others are ignored."

