#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:3
msgid ""
"`oras` Manifest は、**OCI registry に置かれた artifact** を pull し、その内容"
"を `helmfile` または `kustomize` に **委譲して** クラスタへ反映する Manifest "
"type です。"
msgstr ""
"An `oras` Manifest is a Manifest type that pulls an **artifact placed in an "
"OCI registry** and **delegates** its content to `helmfile` or `kustomize` to "
"apply to the cluster."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:6
msgid ""
"pull → 展開 → 委譲先 Manager の呼び出し、までを ORAS Manager がまとめて行いま"
"す。 artifact の中身そのものは helmfile / kustomize と同じ作法で書きます。"
msgstr ""
"The ORAS Manager handles the pull → extract → invoke delegate Manager chain. "
"The artifact's content itself is written in the same idiomatic style as "
"helmfile / kustomize."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:11
msgid ""
"ORAS Manifest の `manifests[].path` は **実体としては使用されません**。 バリ"
"デーション都合で空にはできないため、何かしらのディレクトリを書きます。"
msgstr ""
"An ORAS Manifest's `manifests[].path` is **not used in practice**. Since "
"validation does not allow it to be empty, write some directory."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:14
msgid ""
"委譲先 Manager に渡される `path` は、pull 後にローカルへ展開された キャッシュ"
"ディレクトリ（必要なら `target` でサブパスへ降りたもの）になります。"
msgstr ""
"The `path` passed to the delegate Manager is the cache directory locally "
"extracted after the pull (descended to a sub-path if `target` is specified)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:19
msgid "`manifests[].oras` のオブジェクトに書きます。"
msgstr "Written inside the `manifests[].oras` object."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:23
msgid "`reference`"
msgstr "`reference`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:23
msgid ""
"OCI artifact の reference。tag 形式 (`ghcr.io/example/foo:v1.0.0`) と digest "
"形式 (`ghcr.io/example/foo@sha256:...`) の両方を受け付けます。"
msgstr ""
"OCI artifact reference. Accepts both the tag form (`ghcr.io/example/"
"foo:v1.0.0`) and the digest form (`ghcr.io/example/foo@sha256:...`)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:24
msgid "`target`"
msgstr "`target`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:24
msgid ""
"展開後の artifact root からの相対サブパス。省略時は root を指します。`..` な"
"どで artifact root を脱出する値は拒否されます。"
msgstr ""
"Relative sub-path from the artifact root after extraction. Omitting it means "
"the root. Values that escape the artifact root via `..` and so on are "
"rejected."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:25
msgid "`plainHTTP`"
msgstr "`plainHTTP`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:25
msgid "`true` のとき registry への接続を HTTP（非 TLS）で行います。"
msgstr "When `true`, connect to the registry over HTTP (non-TLS)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:26
msgid "`insecureSkipVerify`"
msgstr "`insecureSkipVerify`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:26
msgid "`true` のとき registry 接続時の TLS 証明書検証をスキップします。"
msgstr ""
"When `true`, skip TLS certificate verification when connecting to the "
"registry."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:27
msgid "`auth`"
msgstr "`auth`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:27
msgid "[ORASAuth](#orasauth)"
msgstr "[ORASAuth](#orasauth)"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:27
msgid ""
"registry の認証情報を override します。省略時は docker config.json を使用しま"
"す。詳細は [認証の解決](#認証の解決) 参照。"
msgstr ""
"Overrides the registry credentials. Defaults to using docker config.json. "
"See [Credential resolution](#認証の解決) for details."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:28
msgid "`delegate`"
msgstr "`delegate`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:28
msgid "[ORASDelegate](#orasdelegate)"
msgstr "[ORASDelegate](#orasdelegate)"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:28
msgid "pull 後の委譲先 Manager の設定。"
msgstr "Configuration of the delegate Manager invoked after the pull."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:30
msgid "ORASAuth"
msgstr "ORASAuth"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:34
msgid "`username`"
msgstr "`username`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:34
msgid "registry のユーザー名。"
msgstr "Registry username."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:35
msgid "`password`"
msgstr "`password`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:35
msgid "registry のパスワード。"
msgstr "Registry password."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:37
msgid ""
"両フィールドが空のときは override 扱いになりません（[認証の解決](#認証の解"
"決) 参照）。"
msgstr ""
"If both fields are empty, this is not treated as an override (see "
"[Credential resolution](#認証の解決))."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:39
msgid "ORASDelegate"
msgstr "ORASDelegate"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:43
msgid "委譲先の Manifest type。`helmfile` または `kustomize`。"
msgstr "Manifest type to delegate to. `helmfile` or `kustomize`."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:44
msgid "`type: helmfile` のときに委譲先へそのまま渡されるオプション。"
msgstr "Options passed to the delegate as-is when `type: helmfile`."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:45
msgid "`type: kustomize` のときに委譲先へそのまま渡されるオプション。"
msgstr "Options passed to the delegate as-is when `type: kustomize`."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:51
msgid "artifact を pull → 委譲先の Build を呼ぶ。"
msgstr "Pull artifact → call the delegate's Build."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:52
msgid "artifact を pull → 委譲先の Apply を呼ぶ。"
msgstr "Pull artifact → call the delegate's Apply."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:53
msgid "artifact を pull → 委譲先の Destroy を呼ぶ。"
msgstr "Pull artifact → call the delegate's Destroy."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:55
msgid "委譲先には次のように新しい `Manifest` が組み立てられて渡されます。"
msgstr "The delegate is invoked with a new `Manifest` assembled like this:"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:57
msgid ""
"`name` / `description` / `tags` / `tests` は元の ORAS Manifest からそのまま引"
"き継ぐ。"
msgstr ""
"`name` / `description` / `tags` / `tests` are carried over from the original "
"ORAS Manifest as-is."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:58
msgid "`type` は `delegate.type`（`helmfile` / `kustomize`）。"
msgstr "`type` is `delegate.type` (`helmfile` / `kustomize`)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:59
msgid ""
"`path` は pull 後のローカルパス（`target` 指定があれば追加でサブパスを結"
"合）。"
msgstr ""
"`path` is the local path after the pull (with sub-path appended if `target` "
"is set)."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:60
msgid ""
"固有フィールドは `delegate.helmfile` / `delegate.kustomize` をそのまま使う。"
msgstr "Specific fields use `delegate.helmfile` / `delegate.kustomize` as-is."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:62
msgid "`Test plugin` も同じ Manifest の文脈で評価されます。"
msgstr "`Test plugin` is also evaluated in the same Manifest context."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:64
msgid "Pull とキャッシュ"
msgstr "Pull and Cache"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:66
msgid ""
"ORAS の pull は **digest 単位でローカルにキャッシュ** されます。 同じ digest "
"を持つ artifact の 2 回目以降の pull は registry にアクセスしません。"
msgstr ""
"ORAS pulls are **cached locally per digest**. Subsequent pulls of an "
"artifact with the same digest do not access the registry."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:69
msgid "キャッシュディレクトリ:"
msgstr "Cache directory:"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:70
msgid "`$XDG_CACHE_HOME` が設定されていれば `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/tazuna/oras`"
msgstr "If `$XDG_CACHE_HOME` is set: `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/tazuna/oras`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:71
msgid "そうでなければ `$HOME/.cache/tazuna/oras`"
msgstr "Otherwise: `$HOME/.cache/tazuna/oras`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:72
msgid "キャッシュ構造:"
msgstr "Cache structure:"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:73
msgid "`blobs/<sanitized digest>/` 配下に artifact を展開する"
msgstr "Artifact is extracted under `blobs/<sanitized digest>/`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:74
msgid "`refs/<sanitized reference>` に tag → digest のマッピングを記録する"
msgstr "Tag → digest mapping is recorded in `refs/<sanitized reference>`"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:75
msgid ""
"`--no-cache` を `apply` / `build` / `destroy` に指定するとキャッシュを無視し"
"て常に registry から再取得します。"
msgstr ""
"Specifying `--no-cache` to `apply` / `build` / `destroy` bypasses the cache "
"and always refetches from the registry."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:76
msgid ""
"`--offline` を指定すると registry へのアクセスを禁止します。キャッシュにヒッ"
"トしなければエラーになります。"
msgstr ""
"Specifying `--offline` forbids registry access. If the cache misses, it is "
"an error."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:77
msgid "`--no-cache` と `--offline` は同時には指定できません。"
msgstr "`--no-cache` and `--offline` cannot be specified together."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:78
msgid ""
"CLI フラグは [`apply` / `build` / `destroy`](../cli/index.md#サブコマンド一"
"覧) のページを参照。"
msgstr ""
"See the [`apply` / `build` / `destroy`](../cli/index.md#サブコマンド一覧) "
"pages for CLI flags."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:80
msgid "展開時の制約"
msgstr "Constraints at Extraction Time"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:82
msgid "artifact 内の tar 展開には **ADR004 で定めた上限** が適用されます。"
msgstr ""
"Tar extraction inside the artifact applies the **upper bounds defined in "
"ADR004**."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:84
msgid "上限"
msgstr "Limit"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:86
msgid "展開後合計サイズ"
msgstr "Total size after extraction"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:86
msgid "1 GiB"
msgstr "1 GiB"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:87
msgid "tar entry 数"
msgstr "Number of tar entries"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:87
msgid "10000"
msgstr "10000"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:89
msgid "以下の不正な entry は拒否されます。"
msgstr "The following invalid entries are rejected."

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:91
msgid "絶対パスを含む entry"
msgstr "Entries containing absolute paths"

#: src/reference/manifest-types/oras.md:92
