"The KinD cluster name is **fixed as `tazuna`**, and the kubeconfig context "
"name is `kind-tazuna`. Because e2e assumes a KinD cluster, the first run of "
"`make test-e2e` internally triggers `make devenv-create` (see also [Testing]"
"(./testing.md))."

